### 16:40–16:55 · Standup có ghi âm

> *"Morning. Last week I finished the feature work — theming, stats, a Supabase backend and a feature-based restructure.*
> *This week is release week. Today I set up the app icon and splash screen, configured three EAS build profiles, moved my environment variables into EAS secrets, and kicked off my first production build for Android.*
> *Tomorrow I'll set up over-the-air updates with EAS Update, and Wednesday I'm submitting to TestFlight and Play internal testing.*
> *One thing I had to be careful about is that anything prefixed EXPO_PUBLIC ends up in the bundle, so it's not really a secret. The actual protection is row level security on the database side."*

### 16:55–17:00 · 5 từ mới

| Từ / cụm | Nghĩa | Câu mẫu |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `kick off` | khởi động, bắt đầu chạy | *I kicked off a production build.* |
| `over-the-air` | cập nhật không qua store | *We push OTA updates.* |
| `roll out` | triển khai dần | *We rolled it out to ten percent first.* |
| `end up in` | rốt cuộc nằm trong | *It ends up in the bundle.* |
| `be careful about` | cẩn thận với | *One thing to be careful about is…* |

